# Browser QA

Playwright is the browser framework.

Run browser checks only when browser behavior changed or when the task explicitly requires E2E proof.
Prefer a relevant spec over the full suite during implementation.

Check as applicable:
- navigation and primary action;
- Russian UI;
- console/page errors;
- unexpected failed requests;
- desktop/mobile layout for changed surface;
- dialog/form interaction;
- persistence after reload for save flows.

Do not create screenshots/review every viewport for backend-only or docs-only changes.
Full desktop/tablet/mobile baseline belongs to Phase Gates or significant UI work.
